  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ""
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cornmeal porridge",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "cornmeal-porridge-dish"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is quicker than oat porridge and considerably more filling. Understanding "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "cornmeal grades",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "polenta-vs-cornmeal"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " matters here: fine cornmeal dissolves to a silky consistency while coarse-ground gives a grainier, more textured result. For Caribbean-style porridge, fine is traditional."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whisking the cornmeal into cold liquid before heating prevents lumps. Once it starts to thicken, keep stirring so it does not catch on the base of the pan. The cinnamon stick adds a subtle warmth throughout cooking; remove it before serving."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 3,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "polenta",
              "amount": 150,
              "unit": "g",
              "prepNote": "fine-ground",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
